    "html": "<p>A circuit consists of a real cell and an external resistor. The following data are available:</p>\n<table><thead><tr><th>Parameter</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Cell electromotive force (emf)</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"9.0\\text{ V}\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>Cell internal resistance</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.5\\ \\Omega\"></span></td></tr><tr><td>External resistor resistance</td><td><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\ \\Omega\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>What is the rate of thermal energy dissipation within the cell?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"3.0\\text{ W}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"6.0\\text{ W}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"12\\text{ W}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"18\\text{ W}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
